    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a2f1a092-6d87-5b59-96af-295238f83082" activityNameId="62ee9fd7-1f5c-5d03-b671-2200eb484fa0" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silver, from combined gold-silver production, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silver, from combined gold-silver production, at refinery
This multi-output process 'mining and refining, gold-silver deposit' delivers the two co-products 'gold, from combined gold-silver-production, at refinery' and 'silver, from combined gold-silver-production, at refinery'. This data set includes the mining in Chile in open pit mine incl. land use.  Air emissions are estimated.;
UUID: 76943d5f-8e51-38f2-918d-bf9e6606cc64
This data set includes the combined mining and refining of gold and silver in an open pit mine in Chile incl. energy and material use, water and air emissions of metals and land use.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Refinement is estimated with electrolysis-data.
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: 2.99 t gold and 112 t silver per year
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: See Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76943d5f-8e51-38f2-918d-bf9e6606cc64.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
